## Amazon Rekognition
- Uses Machine Learning (ML) to analyze images and videos
- Detects objects, people, text, and scenes
- Content moderation:
  - Detects inappropriate, unwanted, or offensive content
  - Set a minimum confidence threshold for items to be flagged
  - Higher threshold = fewer items flagged, lower threshold = more items flagged

## Amazon Augmented AI (A2I)
- Adds human review to Machine Learning predictions
- Allows humans to review and verify predictions
- Can send low-confidence predictions for human review

## Amazon Transcribe
- Converts speech into text
- Uses deep learning called ASR (Automatic Speech Recognition) to convert speech into text quickly and accurately
- PII (Personally Identifiable Information) identification and redaction in supported workflows
- Supports multiple languages

## Amazon Polly
- Converts text into lifelike speech using deep learning (Text-to-Speech)
- Lexicons: Customize the pronunciation of specific words
- SSML (Speech Synthesis Markup Language): Control pronunciation, volume, pitch, speed, and pauses in speech

## Amazon Translate
- Uses Machine Learning to translate text between languages
- Supports multilingual applications and real-time translation

## Amazon Lex
- Builds conversational interfaces using voice and text
- Uses ASR (Automatic Speech Recognition) to convert speech into text
- Uses NLU (Natural Language Understanding) to understand user intent
- Integrates with Amazon Connect to build virtual contact centers

## Amazon Connect
- Cloud-based virtual contact center
- Enables customer service through voice and chat
- Integrates with Amazon Lex for conversational self-service

## Amazon Comprehend
- Uses NLP (Natural Language Processing) to analyze and understand text
- Fully managed and serverless service
- Identifies relationships between words and entities in text
- Detects sentiment, key phrases, entities, and language

## Amazon Comprehend Medical
- Uses NLP and Machine Learning to analyze medical text
- Detects medical information, including PHI (Protected Health Information)
- Helps identify and protect sensitive health information

## Amazon SageMaker
- Fully managed service for developers and data scientists to build, train, and deploy Machine Learning (ML) models
- Simplifies the entire ML workflow
- Supports creating, training, and deploying custom ML models

## Amazon Kendra
- Intelligent document search service powered by Machine Learning (ML)
- Helps users find relevant information across large amounts of documents
- Uses natural language queries to return relevant answers and information

## Amazon Personalize
- Machine Learning service to build applications with real-time personalized recommendations
- Provides personalized product, content, and user recommendations
- Uses user behavior and preferences to improve recommendations

## Amazon Textract
- Extracts text, handwriting, and structured data from scanned documents using AI and Machine Learning
- Can extract information from forms and tables
- Goes beyond simple OCR (Optical Character Recognition) by identifying document structure




